# Frontend source/build requires no provider, JWT, database or LLM secrets.
# All browser API calls use same-origin /api/*.
# Set BACKEND_ORIGIN as a Cloudflare Pages runtime variable AFTER backend hosting.
# Example only: BACKEND_ORIGIN=https://api.your-domain.com
# Leave it unset to deploy the frontend shell first (API responds 503).
# Local Vite-only development can set FASTAPI_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8002

# Separate source repositories require no new runtime variables; keep private values out of Git.
